@startuml student-domain
!include _style.puml
title Student Domain

class StudentProfile <<Aggregate Root>> {
  +Id: UUID
  +UserId: UUID
  +DisplayName: string
  +EducationLevel: EducationLevel
  +LearningGoal: string
  +Timezone: string
  +UpdateProfile()
  +ReplaceInterests()
}
class SubjectInterest <<Entity>> {
  +SubjectId: UUID
  +Priority: int
}
enum EducationLevel {
  Primary
  LowerSecondary
  UpperSecondary
  University
  Adult
}

StudentProfile "1" *-- "0..*" SubjectInterest
StudentProfile --> EducationLevel
note bottom of SubjectInterest
SubjectId là external reference, không phải foreign key xuyên TutorDb.
end note
@enduml

